    "disclaimer": "<p>*Zero drug diversions and zero doubt messages are not guarantees and are aspirational in nature.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Trinkoff AM, Selby VL, Han K, et al. The Prevalence of Substance Use and Substance Use Problems in Registered Nurses: Estimates From the Nurse Worklife and Wellness Study. Journal of Nursing Regulation. 2022: 12(4), 35 - 46.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>For maximum effectiveness, priming solution water levels must be maintained by hospitals and patches must be cut before disposal.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n",
